AnyTyp Notice & Attribution
===========================

AnyTyp converts office documents, ebooks, spreadsheets, presentations, PDFs,
Markdown, HTML, LaTeX, JSON, CSV/TSV, and plain text into idiomatic Typst (.typ).

Portions of the binary/archive document frontends, shared XML/OLE/math helpers,
and intermediate document model derive from `anydoc`
(https://github.com/firecrawl/anydoc), licensed under the MIT License:
